# Somo brand assets

Before adding or changing logos, favicons, or nav marks:

1. Read [docs/Brand/LOGO_AND_ICON_SSOT.md](docs/Brand/LOGO_AND_ICON_SSOT.md).
2. Use files from `unified-dashboard/assets/brand/` only.
3. Run `npm run brand:sync` after updating SSOT — do not hand-copy one-off logos into `middleware-platform/public/`.

**Logo (light UI):** `somo-logo.png` (gecko + wordmark).

**Icon / favicon:** `somo-icon.png` and generated `favicon.*` — never `somo-logo-wordmark.svg`, never CSS text logos, never new gecko SVGs for nav or favicon.

**Dark green bars:** `somo-icon.png` + League Spartan “Somo” text, or full lockup per SSOT doc — not text-only SVG.

Do not create DocLittle spans, dodgecall marks, or AI-generated wordmarks.
